    "text": "By Dave Preston ,\n19 hours ago The Mike Locksley era is over. On Wednesday, the University of Maryland head football coach and the school agreed to part ways after a 2-5 start to the season that included five straight losses, including last month’s 54-3 debacle at home to UCLA. The program is 38-49 since Locksley... Read full article",
